--
-- The parry scheduler subtracts latency from every fire time, so a single noisy
-- sample translates directly into a missed parry. `Data Ping` jitters by tens of
-- milliseconds frame to frame, so we keep an exponential moving average and let
-- callers choose between the raw and the smoothed value.

