--     :FireServer("Block")
--     :FireServer("UnBlock")
--
-- Hunter kicks for `__namecall` hooks (Error Code: 267), so every call here goes
-- straight through the instance method — no metamethod indirection, no closure
-- wrapping, no cached namecall trampolines.

